{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, minimal, elegant footer section for the babywear brand KISS & KRY, replicating the uploaded reference screenshot as closely as possible.
    
    STRICT INSTRUCTION: The uploaded screenshot is the exact design reference. Do not redesign, reinterpret, or introduce a different layout. Match the positioning, spacing, proportions, background, contact cards, typography and alignment.
    
    1. OVERALL SECTION DESIGN
    
    Full-width footer section.
    
    Background: warm ivory cream (#F5F3E7).
    
    Maximum content width: 1200px.
    
    Desktop horizontal padding: 45px.
    
    Desktop vertical padding: 45px.
    
    Minimal, premium, editorial aesthetic.
    
    All main brand content centred.
    
    Use Montserrat typography throughout.
    
    No gradients, heavy shadows or decorative illustrations.
    
    2. CENTRED BRAND LOGO
    
    At the top centre, display the original Kiss & Kry logo.
    
    Use an editable Shopify image picker.
    
    Preserve the original logo artwork and proportions.
    
    Logo width: approximately 125px.
    
    Height: auto.
    
    Centre aligned.
    
    Maintain transparent background if available.
    
    Do not recreate or modify the logo using text.
    
    Below the logo, add the tagline:
    
    "Born from bamboo. Made for baby."
    
    Styling:
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    Font size: 11px.
    
    Colour: muted warm grey (#858575).
    
    Centre aligned.
    
    Margin-top: 12px.
    
    Margin-bottom: 35px.
    
    3. FOUR CONTACT CARDS
    
    Create exactly FOUR equally sized horizontal contact cards in one row.
    
    Desktop layout:
    
    Four equal-width columns.
    
    Gap: 12px.
    
    Each card approximately 215px wide and 65px tall.
    
    Background: white (#FFFFFF).
    
    Border radius: 15px.
    
    No prominent border.
    
    Very subtle soft shadow.
    
    Internal horizontal padding: 15px.
    
    Vertically centre all content.
    
    Each card must contain:
    
    Circular olive icon background on the left.
    
    Small uppercase category label.
    
    Contact name or number below.
    
    Small diagonal arrow icon at the far right.
    
    CARD 1 – INSTAGRAM
    
    Icon:
    
    Instagram outline SVG.
    
    Circular background: muted olive (#626B4C).
    
    Icon colour: white.
    
    Circle size: 38px.
    
    Label:
    "INSTAGRAM"
    
    Main text:
    "@kissandkry"
    
    Link:
    https://www.instagram.com/kissandkry/
    
    CARD 2 – FACEBOOK
    
    Icon:
    
    Facebook SVG.
    
    Same circular olive icon container.
    
    Label:
    "FACEBOOK"
    
    Main text:
    "Kiss & Kry"
    
    Link:
    https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61563831763161
    
    CARD 3 – WHATSAPP
    
    Icon:
    
    WhatsApp outline SVG.
    
    Same circular olive icon container.
    
    Label:
    "WHATSAPP"
    
    Main text:
    "+91 99997 38480"
    
    Link:
    https://wa.me/919999738480
    
    CARD 4 – CALL US
    
    Icon:
    
    Telephone outline SVG.
    
    Same circular olive icon container.
    
    Label:
    "CALL US"
    
    Main text:
    "+91 99997 38480"
    
    Link:
    tel:+919999738480
    
    CONTACT CARD TYPOGRAPHY
    
    Category label:
    
    Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    8px.
    
    Uppercase.
    
    Letter spacing: 1.5px.
    
    Colour: #858575.
    
    Main contact text:
    
    Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    11px.
    
    Colour: #555849.
    
    Arrow:
    
    Small northeast arrow.
    
    Colour: #A8AD91.
    
    Size: 12px.
    
    All four cards must have identical dimensions and alignment.
    
    Make each entire card clickable.
    
    4. CENTRED NAVIGATION MENU
    
    Below the four contact cards, create a single horizontally aligned navigation menu.
    
    Display exactly these six links:
    
    Shop
    
    Why bamboo
    
    Our story
    
    Reviews
    
    Care guide
    
    FAQ
    
    Styling:
    
    Horizontal layout.
    
    Centre aligned.
    
    Gap: 30px.
    
    Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Font size: 11px.
    
    Colour: dark olive (#626B4C).
    
    No background.
    
    No borders.
    
    No underline by default.
    
    Subtle colour transition on hover.
    
    Each navigation item must have an editable destination URL.
    
    5. BOTTOM FOOTER BAR
    
    Add a thin horizontal divider below the navigation.
    
    Divider:
    
    Width: 100%.
    
    Height: 1px.
    
    Colour: #E5E0D2.
    
    Margin-top: 35px.
    
    Margin-bottom: 20px.
    
    Create a bottom horizontal row with two aligned sections.
    
    LEFT – COPYRIGHT
    
    Text:
    
    "© 2026 Kiss & Kry. All rights reserved."
    
    Styling:
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    Font size: 9px.
    
    Colour: #858575.
    
    Left aligned.
    
    RIGHT – LEGAL LINKS
    
    Display four links in one horizontal row:
    
    Shipping policy
    
    Returns & refunds
    
    Privacy policy
    
    Terms of service
    
    Styling:
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    Font size: 9px.
    
    Colour: #858575.
    
    Gap: 20px.
    
    Right aligned.
    
    No underline by default.
    
    Hover colour: #626B4C.
    
    Use Shopify's native policy URLs wherever available.
    
    6. EXACT COLOUR PALETTE
    
    Use the following colours:
    
    Main background: #F5F3E7
    
    Contact card background: #FFFFFF
    
    Primary olive: #626B4C
    
    Secondary olive: #777D5D
    
    Main text: #555849
    
    Secondary text: #858575
    
    Divider: #E5E0D2
    
    Arrow icon: #A8AD91
    
    Preserve the original Kiss & Kry logo colours:
    
    Burgundy: #7C0504
    
    Terracotta: #93331D
    
    Golden Ochre: #C58C49
    
    Peach Gold: #F1B26D
    
    Do not recolour the uploaded logo.
    
    7. TYPOGRAPHY
    
    Use Montserrat exclusively.
    
    Tagline: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Contact category labels: Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Contact information: Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Navigation: Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Copyright: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Legal links: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Maintain consistent letter spacing and a premium typography hierarchy.
    
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background: #F5F3E7;
    color: #555849;
    padding: 45px 20px;
    font-family: {{ settings.type_body_font.family }}, Montserrat, sans-serif;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  .ai-kry-footer__inner-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer__brand-{{ ai_gen_id }} { text-align: center; }
  .ai-kry-footer__logo-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 125px;
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer__logo-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 125px;
    height: 70px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer__logo-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }
  .ai-kry-footer__tagline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin: 12px 0 35px;
    color: #858575;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer__contacts-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer__card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    min-width: 0;
    min-height: 65px;
    padding: 10px 15px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 15px;
    color: #555849;
    text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 9px rgba(69, 65, 45, 0.07);
  }
  .ai-kry-footer__icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    flex: 0 0 38px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #626B4C;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer__icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.7; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .ai-kry-footer__icon--facebook-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg { fill: currentColor; stroke: none; }
  .ai-kry-footer__card-copy-{{ ai_gen_id }} { min-width: 0; flex: 1; }
  .ai-kry-footer__label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    color: #858575;
    font-size: 8px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer__value-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: #555849;
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer__arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} { flex: 0 0 auto; color: #A8AD91; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1; }
  .ai-kry-footer__nav-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 15px 30px;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer__nav a {
    color: #626B4C;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 160ms ease;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer__nav a:hover, .ai-kry-footer__nav a:focus-visible { color: #777D5D; }
  .ai-kry-footer__bottom-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
    border-top: 1px solid #E5E0D2;
    margin-top: 35px;
    padding-top: 20px;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer__copyright-{{ ai_gen_id }}, .ai-kry-footer__legal-{{ ai_gen_id }} a {
    color: #858575;
    font-size: 9px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer__legal-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 20px; }
  .ai-kry-footer__legal-{{ ai_gen_id }} a { text-decoration: none; }
  .ai-kry-footer__legal-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:hover, .ai-kry-footer__legal-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:focus-visible { color: #626B4C; }
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} { padding: 36px 20px; }
    .ai-kry-footer__inner-{{ ai_gen_id }} { width: 100%; }
    .ai-kry-footer__contacts-{{ ai_gen_id }} { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .ai-kry-footer__card-{{ ai_gen_id }} { padding: 10px; gap: 8px; }
    .ai-kry-footer__icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} { width: 34px; height: 34px; flex-basis: 34px; }
    .ai-kry-footer__bottom-{{ ai_gen_id }} { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
    .ai-kry-footer__legal-{{ ai_gen_id }} { justify-content: flex-start; gap: 8px 16px; }
  }
  @media screen and (max-width: 380px) {
    .ai-kry-footer__contacts-{{ ai_gen_id }} { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<footer class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-kry-footer__inner-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-kry-footer__brand-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.logo != blank %}
        <img class="ai-kry-footer__logo-{{ ai_gen_id }}" src="{{ block.settings.logo | image_url: width: 300 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.logo.alt | default: shop.name | escape }}" width="125" height="{{ block.settings.logo.height | times: 125 | divided_by: block.settings.logo.width }}" loading="lazy">
      {% else %}
        <div class="ai-kry-footer__logo-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>
      {% endif %}
      <p class="ai-kry-footer__tagline-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Born from bamboo. Made for baby.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-kry-footer__contacts-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <a class="ai-kry-footer__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}" href="https://www.instagram.com/kissandkry/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Instagram, @kissandkry">
        <span class="ai-kry-footer__icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3.5" y="3.5" width="17" height="17" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="17.6" cy="6.6" r=".8" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></span>
        <span class="ai-kry-footer__card-copy-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><span class="ai-kry-footer__label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">INSTAGRAM</span><span class="ai-kry-footer__value-{{ ai_gen_id }}">@kissandkry</span></span><span class="ai-kry-footer__arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
      <a class="ai-kry-footer__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}" href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61563831763161" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Facebook, Kiss & Kry">
        <span class="ai-kry-footer__icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-kry-footer__icon--facebook-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M13.6 21v-8h2.7l.4-3.1h-3.1v-2c0-.9.3-1.5 1.6-1.5h1.7V3.6c-.3 0-1.3-.1-2.5-.1-2.5 0-4.2 1.5-4.2 4.3v2.1H7.4V13h2.8v8h3.4z"/></svg></span>
        <span class="ai-kry-footer__card-copy-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><span class="ai-kry-footer__label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">FACEBOOK</span><span class="ai-kry-footer__value-{{ ai_gen_id }}">Kiss &amp; Kry</span></span><span class="ai-kry-footer__arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
      <a class="ai-kry-footer__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}" href="https://wa.me/919999738480" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="WhatsApp, +91 99997 38480">
        <span class="ai-kry-footer__icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20.2 11.7a8.2 8.2 0 0 1-12.1 7.2L3 20l1.2-4.9a8.2 8.2 0 1 1 16-3.4z"/><path d="M8.2 7.8c.2-.4.4-.4.7-.4h.4c.2 0 .3.1.4.4l.7 1.6c.1.2 0 .4-.1.6l-.5.6c-.2.2-.2.4 0 .6.5.9 1.2 1.6 2.1 2.1.2.1.4.1.6-.1l.7-.8c.2-.2.4-.2.6-.1l1.5.7c.2.1.3.2.3.4 0 .3-.2 1.1-.6 1.4-.4.4-1 .6-1.7.5-1-.1-2.2-.7-3.6-1.9-1.6-1.4-2.6-3.1-2.8-4.1-.2-.8.1-1.3.3-1.5z"/></svg></span>
        <span class="ai-kry-footer__card-copy-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><span class="ai-kry-footer__label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">WHATSAPP</span><span class="ai-kry-footer__value-{{ ai_gen_id }}">+91 99997 38480</span></span><span class="ai-kry-footer__arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
      <a class="ai-kry-footer__card-{{ ai_gen_id }}" href="tel:+919999738480" aria-label="Call us, +91 99997 38480">
        <span class="ai-kry-footer__icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 3.8 9.8 7l-1.7 2.2a14.2 14.2 0 0 0 6.7 6.7l2.2-1.7 3.2 2.8-.8 3c-.2.7-.9 1.1-1.6 1C9.9 19.8 4.2 14.1 3 6.2c-.1-.7.3-1.4 1-1.6L7 3.8z"/></svg></span>
        <span class="ai-kry-footer__card-copy-{{ ai_gen_id }}"><span class="ai-kry-footer__label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">CALL US</span><span class="ai-kry-footer__value-{{ ai_gen_id }}">+91 99997 38480</span></span><span class="ai-kry-footer__arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <nav class="ai-kry-footer__nav-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-label="Footer navigation">
      <a href="{{ block.settings.shop_url | default: routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Shop</a>
      <a href="{{ block.settings.bamboo_url | default: routes.root_url }}">Why bamboo</a>
      <a href="{{ block.settings.story_url | default: routes.root_url }}">Our story</a>
      <a href="{{ block.settings.reviews_url | default: routes.root_url }}">Reviews</a>
      <a href="{{ block.settings.care_url | default: routes.root_url }}">Care guide</a>
      <a href="{{ block.settings.faq_url | default: routes.root_url }}">FAQ</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="ai-kry-footer__bottom-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <span class="ai-kry-footer__copyright-{{ ai_gen_id }}">© 2026 Kiss &amp; Kry. All rights reserved.</span>
      <nav class="ai-kry-footer__legal-{{ ai_gen_id }}" aria-label="Legal links">
        <a href="{{ block.settings.shipping_url | default: shop.shipping_policy.url | default: routes.root_url }}">Shipping policy</a>
        <a href="{{ block.settings.returns_url | default: routes.refund_policy_url | default: routes.root_url }}">Returns &amp; refunds</a>
        <a href="{{ block.settings.privacy_url | default: shop.privacy_policy.url | default: routes.root_url }}">Privacy policy</a>
        <a href="{{ block.settings.terms_url | default: shop.terms_of_service.url | default: routes.root_url }}">Terms of service</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Kiss & Kry footer",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "logo", "label": "Brand logo" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "desktop_width_percent", "label": "Desktop width", "min": 50, "max": 100, "step": 5, "unit": "%", "default": 100 },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Navigation links" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "shop_url", "label": "Shop" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "bamboo_url", "label": "Why bamboo" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "story_url", "label": "Our story" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "reviews_url", "label": "Reviews" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "care_url", "label": "Care guide" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "faq_url", "label": "FAQ" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Legal links" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "shipping_url", "label": "Shipping policy" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "returns_url", "label": "Returns and refunds" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "privacy_url", "label": "Privacy policy" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "terms_url", "label": "Terms of service" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Kiss & Kry footer" }],
  "tag": null,
  "class": "kiss-and-kry-footer-block"
}
{% endschema %}